{
  "name": "Echoline",
  "category": "Business dashboards",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "A night-mode marketing desk for a live-events promoter, with a tour map that lights up as tickets sell",
  "about": "A nine-page marketing app for a concert promoter running three European tours, drawn in near-black with acid lime and violet, or on soundcheck paper in the light theme. Its tour map is a dot-drawn Europe: the route glides from city to city, a glowing dot travels the dates still to play, and every stop rings up its sell-out meter as live ticket sales land. Campaigns, on-sale countdowns with launch checklists, audience growth, the shared ad wallet with autopilot rules, a report builder and the team are all working pages.",
  "how": [
    "Pick a tour above the map and watch the camera glide to its route; click a stop or a date to see that show",
    "Keep an eye on the box office feed: a sale lands every few seconds and the matching city pings on the map",
    "Join a campaign squad, filter and sort campaigns, open one to pause it, edit it or go live",
    "Tick launch steps on an on-sale card, add your own steps and watch the progress ring fill",
    "Compare artists on the audience chart, top up the wallet and switch autopilot rules on or off",
    "Build a report, save it as a view and export it as CSV",
    "Press Ctrl+K to jump anywhere; reset the demo data in Settings"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "dashboard",
    "marketing",
    "events",
    "concerts",
    "tour map",
    "campaigns",
    "dark mode",
    "ticketing"
  ],
